    <div style='color:#8B95A5; font-size:14px; font-family:monospace; line-height:2.2;'>
    <div style='color:#00F0FF'>1. GRID INPUT</div>
    Available capacity vs node demand.<br><br>
    
    <div style='color:#FFFFFF'>2. LOAD DEMAND + PRIORITY</div>
    Critical infrastructure is assigned high mathematical weights.<br><br>
    
    <div style='color:#FFFFFF'>3. OPTIMIZATION MODEL</div>
    Objective: Minimize Σ(Priority Weight × Unmet Demand).<br><br>
    
    <div style='color:#FFFFFF'>4. DISCRETIZATION</div>
    Continuous power (kW) is partitioned into fixed chunks, becoming binary variables.<br><br>
    
