    Constraints (Allocated ≤ Supply) are mapped as quadratic penalties.<br><br>
    
    <div style='color:#FF9F43'>6. QAOA SIMULATION</div>
    The QUBO is evaluated as an Ising Hamiltonian via classical Statevector simulation.<br><br>
    
    <div style='color:#FFFFFF'>7. CLASSICAL REFERENCE</div>
    A SciPy MILP exact solver computes the absolute optimal baseline.
